# Third-party notices

This repository is an independent customization set for **DeepSeek Harness**.
It redistributes **none** of DeepSeek Harness itself — no application binary, no
`app.asar`, and no `@deepseek-ai/*` package. The plugins here only interoperate
with a DeepSeek Harness installation you already have.

